(2766825, 386696, 34938, '<td valign="top">the composition is superb, and the use of black is impactful and in your face. The tonality is spot on for this image and the focus is great as well. You must have a great camera and lens combination to achieve this kind of result and the editing is first class...I am not sure about the black frame you used and the width of it at 320px, but the rest of the shot more than makes up for it...I think this might ribbon and I would be surprised if it doesn''t...this is what this site is all about, photos like this that just make you sit back and go "WOW, now, that''s what I call black..." I am looking forward to seeing more of your work in the future...good luck ;-)</td>', 'the composition is superb, and the use of black is impactful and in your face. The tonality is spot on for this image and the focus is great as well. You must have a great camera and lens combination to achieve this kind of result and the editing is first class...I am not sure about the black frame you used and the width of it at 320px, but the rest of the shot more than makes up for it...I think this might ribbon and I would be surprised if it doesn''t...this is what this site is all about, photos like this that just make you sit back and go "WOW, now, that''s what I call black..." I am looking forward to seeing more of your work in the future...good luck ;-)', '2006-08-28 06:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
