(2767152, 385430, 60173, '<td valign="top">I love skies like that. One of the most breathe-taking aspects of that type of cloud is that they''re usually so high in the sky and blanket nearly the whole thing. While I was sitting here looking at it my head tilted to the right, and the photo seemed more impressive. The lines carry the photo more as a horizontal image.</td>', 'I love skies like that. One of the most breathe-taking aspects of that type of cloud is that they''re usually so high in the sky and blanket nearly the whole thing. While I was sitting here looking at it my head tilted to the right, and the photo seemed more impressive. The lines carry the photo more as a horizontal image.', '2006-08-28 09:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
