(2768097, 386131, 60862, '<td valign="top">The potential for an interesting shot is here, the stuff of interest is too little of the vertical extent.  It might have worked better to crop so the mountains and reflection take up more space.  You''ll also get more zing by moving the shoreline out of the center of the picture.  You can still get the mountains and the reflection in the shot without that.<br/> <br/>And, as I''m sure you''ll hear repeatedly, the horizon is tilted.</td>', 'The potential for an interesting shot is here, the stuff of interest is too little of the vertical extent.  It might have worked better to crop so the mountains and reflection take up more space.  You''ll also get more zing by moving the shoreline out of the center of the picture.  You can still get the mountains and the reflection in the shot without that. And, as I''m sure you''ll hear repeatedly, the horizon is tilted.', '2006-08-28 15:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
