(2768145, 386470, 64571, '<td valign="top">Good idea and great colors!  I considered doing a coblestone street as my challenge, but decided against it.  Yours is much better.</td>', 'Good idea and great colors!  I considered doing a coblestone street as my challenge, but decided against it.  Yours is much better.', '2006-08-28 15:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
