(2768194, 386765, 64571, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, but in my opinion, there is a subject...</td>', 'Beautiful picture, but in my opinion, there is a subject...', '2006-08-28 15:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768199, 386409, 64571, '<td valign="top">Neat idea!</td>', 'Neat idea!', '2006-08-28 15:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768202, 386131, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, dear.  Lots of people are going to tell you about your lake horizon, I''m afraid.  Sometimes, even if it is an optical illusion, it''s best to make it straight if possible :)<br/> <br/>Still, it''s a beautiful image and you must have had a fine time enjoying it while you were there.</td>', 'Oh, dear.  Lots of people are going to tell you about your lake horizon, I''m afraid.  Sometimes, even if it is an optical illusion, it''s best to make it straight if possible :) Still, it''s a beautiful image and you must have had a fine time enjoying it while you were there.', '2006-08-28 15:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768204, 386659, 64571, '<td valign="top">brillant colors</td>', 'brillant colors', '2006-08-28 15:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768207, 386256, 64571, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept.</td>', 'I really like the concept.', '2006-08-28 15:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
