(2768226, 385897, 42100, '<td valign="top">What a fascinating location.  Great composition and looks like you handled very well what was some difficult lighting.</td>', 'What a fascinating location.  Great composition and looks like you handled very well what was some difficult lighting.', '2006-08-28 15:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
