(2768230, 385912, 42100, '<td valign="top">What a lush and beautiful place, I''d love to see this in person some day.  Very nice job handling what must of been some very tricky lighting.</td>', 'What a lush and beautiful place, I''d love to see this in person some day.  Very nice job handling what must of been some very tricky lighting.', '2006-08-28 15:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768232, 386696, 14476, '<td valign="top">I see you''re trying for a Mark Rothko effect.</td>', 'I see you''re trying for a Mark Rothko effect.', '2006-08-28 15:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768233, 386731, 42100, '<td valign="top">What an awesome scene stretched out before us.  Great sky and very cool photograph!</td>', 'What an awesome scene stretched out before us.  Great sky and very cool photograph!', '2006-08-28 15:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768236, 386827, 64571, '<td valign="top">Way cool picture and even cooler title!</td>', 'Way cool picture and even cooler title!', '2006-08-28 15:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768244, 385346, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very cool abstract photograph.  The blue and yellow tones grab my attention to keep me looking longer at this photo, and I''m pretty sure I know what I''m looking at.  Great job!</td>', 'Very cool abstract photograph.  The blue and yellow tones grab my attention to keep me looking longer at this photo, and I''m pretty sure I know what I''m looking at.  Great job!', '2006-08-28 15:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768245, 386255, 14476, '<td valign="top">I like this the best of the shore rocks.  Lots of variety, colors, texture without being messy.  <br/> <br/>Nice.</td>', 'I like this the best of the shore rocks.  Lots of variety, colors, texture without being messy.   Nice.', '2006-08-28 15:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768250, 386259, 64571, '<td valign="top">Love the different colors!</td>', 'Love the different colors!', '2006-08-28 15:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768257, 386124, 42100, '<td valign="top">This is a great "image w/o subject" photo.  The only thing that would makes this better is if the blacks in this photo were pure black and the some of the trees didn''t have blown detail.</td>', 'This is a great "image w/o subject" photo.  The only thing that would makes this better is if the blacks in this photo were pure black and the some of the trees didn''t have blown detail.', '2006-08-28 15:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768260, 384699, 64571, '<td valign="top">hurts my eyes</td>', 'hurts my eyes', '2006-08-28 15:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768264, 386762, 42100, '<td valign="top">I love that awesome foggy light, you''ve got some great color tones in this photo.  I wonder if some more of the road filling the bottom of the photo might create a stronger dynamic balance.</td>', 'I love that awesome foggy light, you''ve got some great color tones in this photo.  I wonder if some more of the road filling the bottom of the photo might create a stronger dynamic balance.', '2006-08-28 16:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768269, 386343, 42100, '<td valign="top">Don''t think it is possible to capture any more texture and detail than you did here, excellent technicals.  My only question is...what the heck is it? :)</td>', 'Don''t think it is possible to capture any more texture and detail than you did here, excellent technicals.  My only question is...what the heck is it? :)', '2006-08-28 16:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768275, 385935, 42100, '<td valign="top">This photo has an interesting combination of dark and foreboding, and peaceful and serene.  Fascinating!</td>', 'This photo has an interesting combination of dark and foreboding, and peaceful and serene.  Fascinating!', '2006-08-28 16:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768277, 386687, 60495, '<td valign="top">Where did he go? It took me a minute to process this one but then I told myself, myself I says there is no subject here.   Good job.</td>', 'Where did he go? It took me a minute to process this one but then I told myself, myself I says there is no subject here.   Good job.', '2006-08-28 16:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
