(2768316, 386474, 57320, '<td valign="top">I think I know where this was taken! The Bellagio, in Las Vegas! Maybe I''m wrong, oh well. This photo has the potential but.....It needs more saturation, And maybe some sharpening.</td>', 'I think I know where this was taken! The Bellagio, in Las Vegas! Maybe I''m wrong, oh well. This photo has the potential but.....It needs more saturation, And maybe some sharpening.', '2006-08-28 16:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
