(2768429, 386696, 60495, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge, nice shade of black, is that original art work? 3.0 to help get the .xx up.</td>', 'Meets challenge, nice shade of black, is that original art work? 3.0 to help get the .xx up.', '2006-08-28 16:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768453, 386686, 59215, '<td valign="top">I love this image! It''s beautiful, the colors are balanced well, and it has a very dramatic feel. I especially like the bit of green on the leaf just right and up of center.... I wasn''t sure about it at first and thought about suggesting that it be changed to blend in, but after thinking on it some more, I like how it contrasts conceptually with the dried up leaves.</td>', 'I love this image! It''s beautiful, the colors are balanced well, and it has a very dramatic feel. I especially like the bit of green on the leaf just right and up of center.... I wasn''t sure about it at first and thought about suggesting that it be changed to blend in, but after thinking on it some more, I like how it contrasts conceptually with the dried up leaves.', '2006-08-28 17:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768470, 385901, 62642, '<td valign="top">Nice colors &amp; texture.</td>', 'Nice colors & texture.', '2006-08-28 17:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768474, 386739, 62642, '<td valign="top">The green is nice.  Not sure about the cropping though.  I do like the slight roll of the hills.</td>', 'The green is nice.  Not sure about the cropping though.  I do like the slight roll of the hills.', '2006-08-28 17:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768476, 386821, 62642, '<td valign="top">I want to walk into this picture.</td>', 'I want to walk into this picture.', '2006-08-28 17:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768477, 386717, 57701, '<td valign="top">firts place! excellent work!</td>', 'firts place! excellent work!', '2006-08-28 17:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768492, 386024, 62642, '<td valign="top">I like how several things could be the focus but no one element dominates.  Seems to capture the spirit of the challenge very well.</td>', 'I like how several things could be the focus but no one element dominates.  Seems to capture the spirit of the challenge very well.', '2006-08-28 17:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768501, 386437, 62642, '<td valign="top">Wherein lies the danger of trespassing?  Very nice image.  Invokes my imagination.</td>', 'Wherein lies the danger of trespassing?  Very nice image.  Invokes my imagination.', '2006-08-28 17:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768519, 386806, 7743, '<td valign="top">Although this image meets the challenge very well I feel that the pattern of lights is very distracting.  (only my opinion)</td>', 'Although this image meets the challenge very well I feel that the pattern of lights is very distracting.  (only my opinion)', '2006-08-28 17:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768539, 385612, 62642, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2006-08-28 17:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768543, 386402, 62642, '<td valign="top">Funny image.  Seems blurry/flat (different backdrop maybe?), but the concept and composition help a lot.</td>', 'Funny image.  Seems blurry/flat (different backdrop maybe?), but the concept and composition help a lot.', '2006-08-28 17:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768555, 386612, 57936, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but the house really looks like the subject of this image... a 3</td>', 'Sorry, but the house really looks like the subject of this image... a 3', '2006-08-28 17:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768557, 386363, 31133, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and rhythm going on here. I especially am drawn to the dark blue near the center.</td>', 'Wonderful colors and rhythm going on here. I especially am drawn to the dark blue near the center.', '2006-08-28 17:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768558, 386715, 57936, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract image</td>', 'Nice abstract image', '2006-08-28 17:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768559, 386806, 57936, '<td valign="top">Well done abstract light drawing. Possibly a bit too busy, but nice.</td>', 'Well done abstract light drawing. Possibly a bit too busy, but nice.', '2006-08-28 17:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768563, 386700, 57936, '<td valign="top">Great crowd shot! The muted colors are effective.</td>', 'Great crowd shot! The muted colors are effective.', '2006-08-28 17:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768564, 386798, 57936, '<td valign="top">A bit too bright at the top of the frame.</td>', 'A bit too bright at the top of the frame.', '2006-08-28 17:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768565, 385910, 57936, '<td valign="top">If all of the twigs were in focus this would be stronger.</td>', 'If all of the twigs were in focus this would be stronger.', '2006-08-28 17:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768568, 386776, 39184, '<td valign="top">I like the soft, pastel colors of the sea and the sky and the simplicity therein.  The rocky shore contrasts nicely with the sea and the sky, but this part of the image seems too grainy, even for sand and rocks.  Maybe a little too much sharpening?</td>', 'I like the soft, pastel colors of the sea and the sky and the simplicity therein.  The rocky shore contrasts nicely with the sea and the sky, but this part of the image seems too grainy, even for sand and rocks.  Maybe a little too much sharpening?', '2006-08-28 17:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768569, 385965, 31133, '<td valign="top">I think this fits the challenge with respect to no subject, but for my taste, it might be more effective with slightly less contrast. The blown highlights in the window and the white shirt in front are a bit distracting. I like the expressions on the crowd very much. Even their postures convey the boredom of waiting, waiting for something.</td>', 'I think this fits the challenge with respect to no subject, but for my taste, it might be more effective with slightly less contrast. The blown highlights in the window and the white shirt in front are a bit distracting. I like the expressions on the crowd very much. Even their postures convey the boredom of waiting, waiting for something.', '2006-08-28 17:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768573, 385306, 57936, '<td valign="top">Not enough of an image to really judge. Too much open space in the bottom right two thirds of the frame.</td>', 'Not enough of an image to really judge. Too much open space in the bottom right two thirds of the frame.', '2006-08-28 17:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2768575, 384212, 57936, '<td valign="top">Would be stronger if it had more compelling patterns or colors. As it is it doesn''t thrill.</td>', 'Would be stronger if it had more compelling patterns or colors. As it is it doesn''t thrill.', '2006-08-28 17:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
