(2770322, 386131, 30608, '<td valign="top">I would like to offer a bit of constructive criticism of a couple of things that would improve this photograph. The first and most obvious is to level the picture across the water line. The second also involves the water line being in the center of the picture. If you changed the crop to the top of the hill on the right you will still see your beautiful blue skies and all the water, but it would move that water line off the center. It''s a nice picture. I hope this helps.</td>', 'I would like to offer a bit of constructive criticism of a couple of things that would improve this photograph. The first and most obvious is to level the picture across the water line. The second also involves the water line being in the center of the picture. If you changed the crop to the top of the hill on the right you will still see your beautiful blue skies and all the water, but it would move that water line off the center. It''s a nice picture. I hope this helps.', '2006-08-29 12:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2770348, 386649, 8437, '<td valign="top">Lake Champlain... this brings me memories..spent 4 years around it.<br/>Anyway, I really like your composition here.</td>', 'Lake Champlain... this brings me memories..spent 4 years around it.Anyway, I really like your composition here.', '2006-08-29 12:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
