(2770630, 385859, 41337, '<td valign="top">The landscape shots in this challenge has been a real mix bag for me. Most of the real "pretty" ones are totally DNMC, IMO. It seems little effort was made to shoot a subjectless photo and instead they just concentrated on putting as much wow factor into it so they can skate by on the challenge part as always. Your however, seem to have taken the challenge to heart like a few others who shot landscapes. This shot is indeed subjectless and it''s because of the way you shot it. Gets a 10 from me. Good luck.</td>', 'The landscape shots in this challenge has been a real mix bag for me. Most of the real "pretty" ones are totally DNMC, IMO. It seems little effort was made to shoot a subjectless photo and instead they just concentrated on putting as much wow factor into it so they can skate by on the challenge part as always. Your however, seem to have taken the challenge to heart like a few others who shot landscapes. This shot is indeed subjectless and it''s because of the way you shot it. Gets a 10 from me. Good luck.', '2006-08-29 14:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2770636, 385935, 41337, '<td valign="top">A little too dark (for the time of day especially) but otherwise a good take to the challenge.</td>', 'A little too dark (for the time of day especially) but otherwise a good take to the challenge.', '2006-08-29 14:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
