(2770900, 386834, 30049, '<td valign="top">Where is everybody?  ;^)  This is a good take for the challenge.  I think it''s interesting how there is a color theme going on here also, and most likely quite unintentional.  Too bad you couldn''t shoo that seagull and person out of there.  ;^)  Overall, very nice.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Where is everybody?  ;^)  This is a good take for the challenge.  I think it''s interesting how there is a color theme going on here also, and most likely quite unintentional.  Too bad you couldn''t shoo that seagull and person out of there.  ;^)  Overall, very nice.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-29 15:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2770902, 386012, 52589, '<td valign="top">I quite like this picture...but it has a subject, as demonstrated by its title.</td>', 'I quite like this picture...but it has a subject, as demonstrated by its title.', '2006-08-29 15:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2770905, 385912, 30049, '<td valign="top">Neat looking place.  Tough environment for getting a properly exposed image.  I like the sun rays that you''ve captured.  Minor bummer about the hot spots in the foreground.  The green foliage in the middleground is quite vibrant.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Neat looking place.  Tough environment for getting a properly exposed image.  I like the sun rays that you''ve captured.  Minor bummer about the hot spots in the foreground.  The green foliage in the middleground is quite vibrant.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-29 15:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2770906, 386371, 30049, '<td valign="top">Uh-oh...I imagine that chair is becoming an unfortunate subject in the ''subjectless'' challenge.  That''s where my eyes want to rest quite comfortably.  :(  Very clever idea, and an interesting play on the challenge description.  Nice looking setup BTW.  ;^)  Good luck.</td>', 'Uh-oh...I imagine that chair is becoming an unfortunate subject in the ''subjectless'' challenge.  That''s where my eyes want to rest quite comfortably.  :(  Very clever idea, and an interesting play on the challenge description.  Nice looking setup BTW.  ;^)  Good luck.', '2006-08-29 15:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2770911, 386423, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ummm...it''s a fern.  Not quite mindless enough to be "subjectless" IMO. On the technical side the image is a little overexposed/blown-out in the highlights, the composition is unfortunately centered (a strong diagonal may have helped), and it''s a little noisy/grainy.   Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Ummm...it''s a fern.  Not quite mindless enough to be "subjectless" IMO. On the technical side the image is a little overexposed/blown-out in the highlights, the composition is unfortunately centered (a strong diagonal may have helped), and it''s a little noisy/grainy.   Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-29 15:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2770912, 386740, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a very soothing image.  Not sure I''m fond of the colorcast, but it''s clean, sharp, and well exposed.  Good use of foreground and middleground focal points.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a very soothing image.  Not sure I''m fond of the colorcast, but it''s clean, sharp, and well exposed.  Good use of foreground and middleground focal points.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-29 15:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2770915, 385081, 30049, '<td valign="top">The subject is hot peppers, specifically the one in the middle.  I think the range of this image is too limited to be "subjectless".  JMO of course.  I like the natural diagonal lines the composition has, and it''s well focused.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The subject is hot peppers, specifically the one in the middle.  I think the range of this image is too limited to be "subjectless".  JMO of course.  I like the natural diagonal lines the composition has, and it''s well focused. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-29 15:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2770918, 386695, 53316, '<td valign="top">Love the colors - it reminds me of cotton candy.</td>', 'Love the colors - it reminds me of cotton candy.', '2006-08-29 15:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2770921, 383662, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very soothing, subjectless image.  The wave lines are a nice element and provide structure to your photo.  Personally, I''m not too crazy about the colors (the gold looks unnatural - although it could be natural, hmmmm).  Anyway, well done overall.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very soothing, subjectless image.  The wave lines are a nice element and provide structure to your photo.  Personally, I''m not too crazy about the colors (the gold looks unnatural - although it could be natural, hmmmm).  Anyway, well done overall.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-29 15:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2770925, 386762, 30049, '<td valign="top">A leading line to nowhere.  ;^)  Of course, some may say that the road itself then becomes the subject as it''s dominant to the viewers'' eye.  I really like the glow in the foliage, and you got out at a good time of day to catch the fog.  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A leading line to nowhere.  ;^)  Of course, some may say that the road itself then becomes the subject as it''s dominant to the viewers'' eye.  I really like the glow in the foliage, and you got out at a good time of day to catch the fog.  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-29 15:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2770940, 386687, 64209, '<td valign="top">Clever concept!</td>', 'Clever concept!', '2006-08-29 16:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2770977, 386247, 42100, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract photo with some nice bokeh circles as accents.</td>', 'Interesting abstract photo with some nice bokeh circles as accents.', '2006-08-29 16:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
