(2775842, 386247, 28097, '<td valign="top">its a string drape with the hanging thingies i think!... nice take...</td>', 'its a string drape with the hanging thingies i think!... nice take...', '2006-08-30 18:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2775847, 385243, 28097, '<td valign="top">a little soft.. maybe not...</td>', 'a little soft.. maybe not...', '2006-08-30 18:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2775957, 385931, 60995, '<td valign="top">This is exactly what I think of when I think of an image without a subject--a picture that is still well composed, with good lighting, that you would want on your wall, but you would just have a hard time telling another person what it''s about or why it''s there.  The only qualm I have is that putting "calcestruzzo" in the title kind of <i>makes </i> it what the photo is about, but if I hadn''t looked it up I never would''ve known what it meant, anyway. 10.</td>', 'This is exactly what I think of when I think of an image without a subject--a picture that is still well composed, with good lighting, that you would want on your wall, but you would just have a hard time telling another person what it''s about or why it''s there.  The only qualm I have is that putting "calcestruzzo" in the title kind of makes  it what the photo is about, but if I hadn''t looked it up I never would''ve known what it meant, anyway. 10.', '2006-08-30 19:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2776668, 386739, 14211, '<td valign="top">but the hills are the subject .</td>', 'but the hills are the subject .', '2006-08-30 22:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
