(2777374, 386775, 31133, '<td valign="top">Clever title. Not sure how I feel about the image on first glance, though. There''s a glare on the plastic covering the melons (one quite distracting), yet everything is quite in focus and I can see you''ve put some thought into the angle, etc. So there''s things that appeal to me and things that don''t here. I''ll have to think about this for a while.</td>', 'Clever title. Not sure how I feel about the image on first glance, though. There''s a glare on the plastic covering the melons (one quite distracting), yet everything is quite in focus and I can see you''ve put some thought into the angle, etc. So there''s things that appeal to me and things that don''t here. I''ll have to think about this for a while.', '2006-08-31 02:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
