(2783184, 386688, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful scene but with the boulders being in the middle area, the eye is dragged to them. However I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt because of all the other "non subjects" in the shot.</td>', 'This is a beautiful scene but with the boulders being in the middle area, the eye is dragged to them. However I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt because of all the other "non subjects" in the shot.', '2006-09-01 11:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
