(2784289, 386669, 50034, '<td valign="top"><b>Great image, but more cartoon than photograph</b>...at least for the voters who have graded my photos.  <i>I''m guessing low score, if concensus leans heavily on photo-realism, but the bright colors could give it a strong bump back up because the concensus always seems to lean towards "O, Look at the pretty colors!"</i>  Much success to you anyway!  :)</td>', 'Great image, but more cartoon than photograph...at least for the voters who have graded my photos.  I''m guessing low score, if concensus leans heavily on photo-realism, but the bright colors could give it a strong bump back up because the concensus always seems to lean towards "O, Look at the pretty colors!"  Much success to you anyway!  :)', '2006-09-01 15:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784295, 385609, 50034, '<td valign="top">Awesome!</td>', 'Awesome!', '2006-09-01 15:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784435, 386694, 42792, '<td valign="top">Original and quite appropriate for this challenge.  Like it.</td>', 'Original and quite appropriate for this challenge.  Like it.', '2006-09-01 16:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784445, 383909, 42792, '<td valign="top">Love this!  I think it''s really what this challenge is all about. 8</td>', 'Love this!  I think it''s really what this challenge is all about. 8', '2006-09-01 16:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784502, 386799, 42792, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  You''ve captured the colour and texture gradients very well to make it look like a painting. 8</td>', 'Very nice.  You''ve captured the colour and texture gradients very well to make it look like a painting. 8', '2006-09-01 16:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784555, 386371, 49384, '<td valign="top">Haha, love it</td>', 'Haha, love it', '2006-09-01 16:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784783, 386819, 61863, '<td valign="top">The tape on the left I find rather distracting - would have rated it higher without that in the composition IMO</td>', 'The tape on the left I find rather distracting - would have rated it higher without that in the composition IMO', '2006-09-01 17:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784815, 386702, 61863, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2006-09-01 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784903, 386705, 17507, '<td valign="top">I think that the people crossing the street, namely the couple, are the subjects of this photo. My eye went straight to them. Aside from that, the image appears to be oversharpened.</td>', 'I think that the people crossing the street, namely the couple, are the subjects of this photo. My eye went straight to them. Aside from that, the image appears to be oversharpened.', '2006-09-01 18:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784905, 385220, 17507, '<td valign="top">great choice of subject- very eerie and evocative. it would have been nice if you could have done something about the purple fringing (or at least, the purple colors look unnatural/unintentional)... and the focus is rather soft, verging on blurry.</td>', 'great choice of subject- very eerie and evocative. it would have been nice if you could have done something about the purple fringing (or at least, the purple colors look unnatural/unintentional)... and the focus is rather soft, verging on blurry.', '2006-09-01 18:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784909, 386834, 17507, '<td valign="top">the umbrella in the forefront is so dominant that I can''t help but see it as the subject of this photograph. It''s a beautiful photo with great colors and good composition, but I have to ring the DNMC bell on this one.</td>', 'the umbrella in the forefront is so dominant that I can''t help but see it as the subject of this photograph. It''s a beautiful photo with great colors and good composition, but I have to ring the DNMC bell on this one.', '2006-09-01 18:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784910, 386733, 17507, '<td valign="top">definitely subjectless; a good example of minimalism; i find myself wishing the grass were sharper. it would be nice to see some well-defined texture there.</td>', 'definitely subjectless; a good example of minimalism; i find myself wishing the grass were sharper. it would be nice to see some well-defined texture there.', '2006-09-01 18:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2784919, 386262, 17507, '<td valign="top">great choice of subject. there is a great deal of interest in a natural object like the bark of a tree. but with regard to execution:<br/>- the narrow DOF makes a large part of the image ''dead space'' without any apparent benefit for the area that is in focus.<br/>- the angle and tilt of the photo are kind of disconcerting to me. i find myself wishing that the orientation were more vertical or horizontal.<br/>- the drop shadow border does not aid the presentation.</td>', 'great choice of subject. there is a great deal of interest in a natural object like the bark of a tree. but with regard to execution:- the narrow DOF makes a large part of the image ''dead space'' without any apparent benefit for the area that is in focus.- the angle and tilt of the photo are kind of disconcerting to me. i find myself wishing that the orientation were more vertical or horizontal.- the drop shadow border does not aid the presentation.', '2006-09-01 18:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785544, 386592, 33672, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting of nothing in particular. It has great tones and texture. Nice job.</td>', 'Looks like a painting of nothing in particular. It has great tones and texture. Nice job.', '2006-09-01 21:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2785551, 386733, 33672, '<td valign="top">A winner if were sharper. Very nice still and great examle of the theme IMO.</td>', 'A winner if were sharper. Very nice still and great examle of the theme IMO.', '2006-09-01 21:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
