(2787844, 386592, 57229, '<td valign="top">Lovely textures. The tree in the foreground helps by giving a sort of ''reference'' for the otherwise abstract nature of the composition, but I think there''s room for just a little more compositional structure (as opposed to rhythmic pattern).<br/>7 for now.</td>', 'Lovely textures. The tree in the foreground helps by giving a sort of ''reference'' for the otherwise abstract nature of the composition, but I think there''s room for just a little more compositional structure (as opposed to rhythmic pattern).7 for now.', '2006-09-02 11:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2787851, 385946, 57229, '<td valign="top">This is either too abstract (for me), or it is wht it says it is. That sort of takes it one side or the other of the goal. Challenge is a tough call. 5</td>', 'This is either too abstract (for me), or it is wht it says it is. That sort of takes it one side or the other of the goal. Challenge is a tough call. 5', '2006-09-02 11:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
