(2787860, 386399, 57229, '<td valign="top">Nice shot/crop. Maybe takes the no subject thing to the point of self-effacement, but the form and the subdued colours are nice. 6 so far.</td>', 'Nice shot/crop. Maybe takes the no subject thing to the point of self-effacement, but the form and the subdued colours are nice. 6 so far.', '2006-09-02 11:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
