(2787883, 386402, 57229, '<td valign="top">Fun shot and a good one too, but it''s all about the things in it. That''s entirely against what I think of as ''without subject''. 5 anyway, as it''s good.</td>', 'Fun shot and a good one too, but it''s all about the things in it. That''s entirely against what I think of as ''without subject''. 5 anyway, as it''s good.', '2006-09-02 12:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
