(2787969, 386246, 57229, '<td valign="top">It''s a good picture in many ways, or at least as long as the people in are a sort of subject. As compositional elements they are too chaotic (and distract by being people). The verticals on the right and on the glass wall facing need to straighten up and fly right. It''s a tough challenge to please. 5</td>', 'It''s a good picture in many ways, or at least as long as the people in are a sort of subject. As compositional elements they are too chaotic (and distract by being people). The verticals on the right and on the glass wall facing need to straighten up and fly right. It''s a tough challenge to please. 5', '2006-09-02 12:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2787989, 386731, 57229, '<td valign="top">An exciting sky, a horizon that looks tilted (I''m sure it isn''t) and a flock of sheep looking for all the world like a flock of sheep. I wonder how they do that. The sky''s fantastic, but as a whole the picture comes over as a jumble of disparate elements. Bæææ. 5</td>', 'An exciting sky, a horizon that looks tilted (I''m sure it isn''t) and a flock of sheep looking for all the world like a flock of sheep. I wonder how they do that. The sky''s fantastic, but as a whole the picture comes over as a jumble of disparate elements. Bæææ. 5', '2006-09-02 12:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788010, 386860, 57229, '<td valign="top">Sharpness and bokeh in contrast - a fine idea. It seems to me (and I''m only guessing) that the petal on the left could use a) and edge and b) sharper internal structure to stop it coming over as a wealth of negative space.<br/> <br/>E for effort? 6</td>', 'Sharpness and bokeh in contrast - a fine idea. It seems to me (and I''m only guessing) that the petal on the left could use a) and edge and b) sharper internal structure to stop it coming over as a wealth of negative space. E for effort? 6', '2006-09-02 12:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788019, 385292, 57229, '<td valign="top">Fair enough - answers to the challenge as I see it. I would prefer less colour saturation - probably just my taste - but the balance of composition is comfortable. 6 and counting...</td>', 'Fair enough - answers to the challenge as I see it. I would prefer less colour saturation - probably just my taste - but the balance of composition is comfortable. 6 and counting...', '2006-09-02 12:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
