(2790376, 386852, 11800, '<td valign="top">commenting not voting. Being an old draftsman, I really enjoy looking at these geometrics. Yhis is good because of the b/w front and then the side color.</td>', 'commenting not voting. Being an old draftsman, I really enjoy looking at these geometrics. Yhis is good because of the b/w front and then the side color.', '2006-09-02 23:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790943, 386840, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is frustrating for me because I love the image, hate the neat image though. I want to see the texture in those barrels and on the pavement, especially since it''s a rough setting - the artificial smoothness from processing really throws me off balance. It occurs to me that maybe that''s what your after. If so, well you see one person''s reaction to the effect anyway. What I love about the image is the composition, with the 2 1/2 barrels in the foreground. I like this colors, particularly the pinks and lavenders and the green text that is framed by those colors. I like the general messiness - the forbidden sign, the post, etc.</td>', 'This is frustrating for me because I love the image, hate the neat image though. I want to see the texture in those barrels and on the pavement, especially since it''s a rough setting - the artificial smoothness from processing really throws me off balance. It occurs to me that maybe that''s what your after. If so, well you see one person''s reaction to the effect anyway. What I love about the image is the composition, with the 2 1/2 barrels in the foreground. I like this colors, particularly the pinks and lavenders and the green text that is framed by those colors. I like the general messiness - the forbidden sign, the post, etc.', '2006-09-03 03:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790945, 386571, 9684, '<td valign="top">wow. this stopped me in my tracks. Wish I were here!</td>', 'wow. this stopped me in my tracks. Wish I were here!', '2006-09-03 03:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790949, 386799, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite of all the seascapes in this entry because of it''s simplicity. Would''ve scored it high in the zen challenge as well. Actually, since I like the image so much, I probably would''ve scored it high in just about any entry :-) The color graduations are very calming, as is the fact that you have left the subtleness of the colors alone. The only criticism is that I''d like to see more detail (maybe) in the water. Is it a tiny bit blurry there, or it might just be me.</td>', 'This is one of my favorite of all the seascapes in this entry because of it''s simplicity. Would''ve scored it high in the zen challenge as well. Actually, since I like the image so much, I probably would''ve scored it high in just about any entry :-) The color graduations are very calming, as is the fact that you have left the subtleness of the colors alone. The only criticism is that I''d like to see more detail (maybe) in the water. Is it a tiny bit blurry there, or it might just be me.', '2006-09-03 03:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790953, 386409, 31133, '<td valign="top">The girl in the background is like a ghost and her pink dress or shirt add to the mystery in the otherwise dark surroundings. Perfect for this challenge in my opinion! Another thing I really enjoy in this picture is the ceiling, because of its shimmery and interesting lines.</td>', 'The girl in the background is like a ghost and her pink dress or shirt add to the mystery in the otherwise dark surroundings. Perfect for this challenge in my opinion! Another thing I really enjoy in this picture is the ceiling, because of its shimmery and interesting lines.', '2006-09-03 04:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790954, 384356, 31133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Sorry for the overused comment, but it really is beautiful. Can''t figure out what it is and that adds to the interest. The thing at left holds my interest and the little blobs of purple are wonderful.</td>', 'Beautiful! Sorry for the overused comment, but it really is beautiful. Can''t figure out what it is and that adds to the interest. The thing at left holds my interest and the little blobs of purple are wonderful.', '2006-09-03 04:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
