(2794246, 383662, 41337, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SandyP:</b></div><hr/><i> Gosh this is beautiful!   I can''t believe this one isn''t a top 10 photo! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>If we ran this challenge over and over each week it wouldn''t surprise me if this scored between 7.2 and 5.2. I''m constantly amazed why some photos do so well and others so poorly and then seemingly reverse order when similar photos are taken in similar challenges. I guess it''s like surfing. You gotta hit that wave at the right time and place except here the wave is invisible.</td>', 'Originally posted by SandyP: Gosh this is beautiful!   I can''t believe this one isn''t a top 10 photo!   If we ran this challenge over and over each week it wouldn''t surprise me if this scored between 7.2 and 5.2. I''m constantly amazed why some photos do so well and others so poorly and then seemingly reverse order when similar photos are taken in similar challenges. I guess it''s like surfing. You gotta hit that wave at the right time and place except here the wave is invisible.', '2006-09-04 02:02:16.000000', NULL, 0),
