(2795357, 383662, 47852, '<td valign="top">This was one of my top picks in the challenge.  I love the contrast of the waves and the colors in the small ripples.  I too, am surprised this one didn''t make the top 10.</td>', 'This was one of my top picks in the challenge.  I love the contrast of the waves and the colors in the small ripples.  I too, am surprised this one didn''t make the top 10.', '2006-09-04 08:37:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2795365, 386829, 47852, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks in the challenge.  I guess entering any shot that has an object or objects in it was risking those DMNC comments, but with no real focal point or mast that stands out, I say it is subjectless.  All of the lines are great, leading your eye around, and the little splashes of color are fantastic.  Well done! :)</td>', 'One of my top picks in the challenge.  I guess entering any shot that has an object or objects in it was risking those DMNC comments, but with no real focal point or mast that stands out, I say it is subjectless.  All of the lines are great, leading your eye around, and the little splashes of color are fantastic.  Well done! :)', '2006-09-04 08:40:57.000000', NULL, 0),
