(2795843, 383958, 59415, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the kind words.  Dis - Pair is when two things have been seperated.  This root was seperated from the soil by the wind.  I wanted that word to carry a douple meaning, and I guess I went a bit too deep with it.</td>', 'Thanks for the kind words.  Dis - Pair is when two things have been seperated.  This root was seperated from the soil by the wind.  I wanted that word to carry a douple meaning, and I guess I went a bit too deep with it.', '2006-09-04 11:27:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2795908, 385897, 31230, '<td valign="top">Woohoo!!! Congrats dude.  Love it.</td>', 'Woohoo!!! Congrats dude.  Love it.', '2006-09-04 11:40:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2795955, 386852, 40683, '<td valign="top">I love the artful geometry of this image.  The selective desat works well here because it neither draws attention to nor away from itself, but rather it works as an integral part of the whole.  The pops of blue against the neutral tones are perfect-especially the little slice of clouded sky.  You''re quite good at creating visually stimulating architectural images. Nice job on this!</td>', 'I love the artful geometry of this image.  The selective desat works well here because it neither draws attention to nor away from itself, but rather it works as an integral part of the whole.  The pops of blue against the neutral tones are perfect-especially the little slice of clouded sky.  You''re quite good at creating visually stimulating architectural images. Nice job on this!', '2006-09-04 11:51:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(2795980, 386829, 16241, '<td valign="top">this is so cool, thought it would finish higher.</td>', 'this is so cool, thought it would finish higher.', '2006-09-04 11:57:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2796109, 386740, 46448, '<td valign="top">I hate to say it, but this shot didn''t deserve the score it got. 6.856 come on man. It deserved alot higher, great photo, great colors, great comp. I would have voted this a 10! Good job on the red, but I think It should have had a higher score...</td>', 'I hate to say it, but this shot didn''t deserve the score it got. 6.856 come on man. It deserved alot higher, great photo, great colors, great comp. I would have voted this a 10! Good job on the red, but I think It should have had a higher score...', '2006-09-04 12:25:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(2796132, 385946, 47933, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club.<br/> <br/>At first glance I thought, "What the heck is that?". Then I took a longer look at it and figured it out. I think a lot of people voted here without giving it a good look as the score deserved to be a bit higher.  <br/> <br/>This was a creative idea indeed. I''m fond of the crop you have showing me the jet on the left. I do think the shallow depth of field hurt you here. If you''d have had plenty of light to shoot this with a small aperture to get the entire image in focus it would''ve been an extremely powerful shot. <br/> <br/>Overall a good effort and idea.<br/> <br/>Cheers - Phil<br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club. At first glance I thought, "What the heck is that?". Then I took a longer look at it and figured it out. I think a lot of people voted here without giving it a good look as the score deserved to be a bit higher.   This was a creative idea indeed. I''m fond of the crop you have showing me the jet on the left. I do think the shallow depth of field hurt you here. If you''d have had plenty of light to shoot this with a small aperture to get the entire image in focus it would''ve been an extremely powerful shot.  Overall a good effort and idea. Cheers - Phil', '2006-09-04 12:30:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2796219, 386857, 58430, '<td valign="top">This is a fine shot..would have been great for the lines challenge too.</td>', 'This is a fine shot..would have been great for the lines challenge too.', '2006-09-04 12:44:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2796263, 386740, 14620, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get a chance to view this challenge, but I''m so glad I got to see this on the front page becuase it is an extremely beautiful image wothy of it''s ribbon.  Congratulations JP!<br/> <br/>~Off to dust the silk flowers now~ ;-)</td>', 'I didn''t get a chance to view this challenge, but I''m so glad I got to see this on the front page becuase it is an extremely beautiful image wothy of it''s ribbon.  Congratulations JP! ~Off to dust the silk flowers now~ ;-)', '2006-09-04 12:51:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2796343, 386259, 50674, '<td valign="top">Well done Amy. I took lots and lots of shots there when they were building the house, right across from my dentist in Malmö. It is such a wonderful place and your shot is a good job, so much better than my shots of it :)</td>', 'Well done Amy. I took lots and lots of shots there when they were building the house, right across from my dentist in Malmö. It is such a wonderful place and your shot is a good job, so much better than my shots of it :)', '2006-09-04 13:18:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2796388, 386740, 17507, '<td valign="top">this was my favorite of the challenge. splendid color work! and based on your photographer''s comments, you definitely earned this one! congratulations.</td>', 'this was my favorite of the challenge. splendid color work! and based on your photographer''s comments, you definitely earned this one! congratulations.', '2006-09-04 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2796462, 386343, 22517, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, wonderful picture!</td>', 'Congratulations, wonderful picture!', '2006-09-04 13:50:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2796469, 386831, 22517, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, great light and shadows!</td>', 'Congratulations, great light and shadows!', '2006-09-04 13:51:47.000000', NULL, 0),
