(2798032, 385923, 53316, '<td valign="top"><i>"I like the faded colours and illustrated feel to it."</i> <br/> <br/>Me tooo!!!!!! I gave this an 8 because I just love exactly what you do about it! The only reason I didn''t score this higher was because I wanted to see it a bit bigger and with a bit more details in the shadows.<br/> <br/><b>Great job</b> on a <b>fantastic</b> image.<br/> <br/>edit: Oh yes, and I wanted to also say that I love the creative title. :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-04 20:07:13.</i></td>', '"I like the faded colours and illustrated feel to it."  Me tooo!!!!!! I gave this an 8 because I just love exactly what you do about it! The only reason I didn''t score this higher was because I wanted to see it a bit bigger and with a bit more details in the shadows. Great job on a fantastic image. edit: Oh yes, and I wanted to also say that I love the creative title. :-)', '2006-09-04 21:05:58.000000', '2006-09-04 21:07:13.000000', 0),
