(2798198, 383942, 35804, '<td valign="top">Oh this light...yes, this beautiful light...what tree wouldn''t throw up it''s arms in sheer delight and dance across the cobblestone in this absolutely perfect light.</td>', 'Oh this light...yes, this beautiful light...what tree wouldn''t throw up it''s arms in sheer delight and dance across the cobblestone in this absolutely perfect light.', '2006-09-04 22:05:27.000000', NULL, 0),
