(2798365, 386661, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  I should have guessed this was yours. I gave this an 8 in voting. Very nicely done! You are doing so well with this great style of yours! The lighting is fantastic, the peeling walls give such character. I have to confess that I didn''t know that was a window.</td>', 'Trading post...  I should have guessed this was yours. I gave this an 8 in voting. Very nicely done! You are doing so well with this great style of yours! The lighting is fantastic, the peeling walls give such character. I have to confess that I didn''t know that was a window.', '2006-09-04 22:44:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2798383, 385897, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  I think it''s a very pretty shot! I gave this a 7 in voting. I''m not quite sure it met the challenge, but it did a hell of a lot better than mine did, LOL. This was a hard challenge to vote on and that score was basically because the picture was so pretty. Congrats on the top 20!</td>', 'Trading post...  I think it''s a very pretty shot! I gave this a 7 in voting. I''m not quite sure it met the challenge, but it did a hell of a lot better than mine did, LOL. This was a hard challenge to vote on and that score was basically because the picture was so pretty. Congrats on the top 20!', '2006-09-04 22:49:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2798391, 386851, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  I thought this was a great abstract and gave it a 7 in voting. I love the black and white! And it''s aptly named, as it does remind me quite a bit of a nightmare. I see at least one skeletal face in there!</td>', 'Trading post...  I thought this was a great abstract and gave it a 7 in voting. I love the black and white! And it''s aptly named, as it does remind me quite a bit of a nightmare. I see at least one skeletal face in there!', '2006-09-04 22:52:35.000000', NULL, 0),
