(2800369, 385859, 53316, '<td valign="top">I voted this a 10. I just love it.<br/> <br/>I want to say though that I found the title a bit distracting. Obviously I didn''t vote down for it but I think that it portrayed a lack of confidence in your entry, which was very unnecessary for this very-much-meeting-the-challenge shot.<br/> <br/>Congrats on your highest score yet! This image totally deserved it.</td>', 'I voted this a 10. I just love it. I want to say though that I found the title a bit distracting. Obviously I didn''t vote down for it but I think that it portrayed a lack of confidence in your entry, which was very unnecessary for this very-much-meeting-the-challenge shot. Congrats on your highest score yet! This image totally deserved it.', '2006-09-05 12:38:12.000000', NULL, 0),
