(2800390, 385612, 53316, '<td valign="top">You may have scored better, I think, using closer to a 150kb size, as that would probably have helped the black areas to look smoother.<br/> <br/>edit: Ah, so the brownish black was intentional, sorry! I think that unfortunately it looks like compression artifacts might look.  But either way, when I came across this image during voting, my attention was drawn immediately to the liquidyblue beautifulness.  I only noticed the background after a second look... so maybe I am completely wrong about how you might have scored better, hehe! Thanks for the PM - is always nice knowing what the photographer intended with an image.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-05 15:24:44.</i></td>', 'You may have scored better, I think, using closer to a 150kb size, as that would probably have helped the black areas to look smoother. edit: Ah, so the brownish black was intentional, sorry! I think that unfortunately it looks like compression artifacts might look.  But either way, when I came across this image during voting, my attention was drawn immediately to the liquidyblue beautifulness.  I only noticed the background after a second look... so maybe I am completely wrong about how you might have scored better, hehe! Thanks for the PM - is always nice knowing what the photographer intended with an image.', '2006-09-05 12:44:48.000000', '2006-09-05 16:24:44.000000', 0),
(2800400, 386659, 53316, '<td valign="top">This is soooooo gorgeous... I love rainbow colors and you did a great job with making a well-used concept fresh and different.<br/> <br/>edit: This would be in my favorites as one of my favorite favorites if I weren''t over 1000 already!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-05 11:49:22.</i></td>', 'This is soooooo gorgeous... I love rainbow colors and you did a great job with making a well-used concept fresh and different. edit: This would be in my favorites as one of my favorite favorites if I weren''t over 1000 already!', '2006-09-05 12:48:19.000000', '2006-09-05 12:49:22.000000', 0),
(2800548, 385965, 57882, '<td valign="top">I thank all those that commented on this shot.  This is the kind of shot that I like to produce, flaws and all.  This was taken with a point and shoot camera, behind a dirty glass window, on a slowly moving train.  I have seen some relatively amazing shots done with a pin-hole camera that had much emotion and character.  That was my goal for this shot.</td>', 'I thank all those that commented on this shot.  This is the kind of shot that I like to produce, flaws and all.  This was taken with a point and shoot camera, behind a dirty glass window, on a slowly moving train.  I have seen some relatively amazing shots done with a pin-hole camera that had much emotion and character.  That was my goal for this shot.', '2006-09-05 13:43:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2800850, 385346, 8891, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your new PB and top 20 finish, Kelly!</td>', 'Congrats on your new PB and top 20 finish, Kelly!', '2006-09-05 15:24:09.000000', NULL, 0),
