(2804616, 386691, 64571, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by xXxscarletxXx:</b></div><hr/><i> Meets the challenge well </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks!  I had a hard time deciding between this picture and my unusual bark picture, but loved the colors in this.  I wish I''d gotten a little more feedback/comments, though, as this was my first challenge.  Thank you for your comment and taking the time to respond.</td>', 'Originally posted by xXxscarletxXx: Meets the challenge well   Thanks!  I had a hard time deciding between this picture and my unusual bark picture, but loved the colors in this.  I wish I''d gotten a little more feedback/comments, though, as this was my first challenge.  Thank you for your comment and taking the time to respond.', '2006-09-06 10:33:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2804775, 386845, 54228, '<td valign="top">Subtle. I like it. The slight blur of the clouds is nice, everything is very minimal. Should I have voted you''d have a 7. Gripes are that it doesn''t really stand out amongst the crowd and that the colours are a little dull. However, overall a good shot.</td>', 'Subtle. I like it. The slight blur of the clouds is nice, everything is very minimal. Should I have voted you''d have a 7. Gripes are that it doesn''t really stand out amongst the crowd and that the colours are a little dull. However, overall a good shot.', '2006-09-06 11:23:11.000000', NULL, 0),
