(2806251, 386858, 52500, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture.  It would have done better in a different challenge, methinks, but what can you do.  I really like the texture and the shallow DOF.  Is it just me, or does the flower look like it is made out of skillfully folded toilet paper?</td>', 'This is a great picture.  It would have done better in a different challenge, methinks, but what can you do.  I really like the texture and the shallow DOF.  Is it just me, or does the flower look like it is made out of skillfully folded toilet paper?', '2006-09-06 16:28:52.000000', NULL, 0),
