(2833162, 383445, 25270, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments.  I guess I had a different interpretation of "no subject" than most of the contributors.  I felt that while the image as a whole represented a strong subject, there was no single part of the photo that your eye was drawn to, thus the photo was subjectless while the message in the photo was strong.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments.  I guess I had a different interpretation of "no subject" than most of the contributors.  I felt that while the image as a whole represented a strong subject, there was no single part of the photo that your eye was drawn to, thus the photo was subjectless while the message in the photo was strong.', '2006-09-13 22:06:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2833361, 386734, 30982, '<td valign="top">Works well for the challenge, but I''d have preferred that one top leaf in focus - it''s prominence and position within the frame makes the fact it''s not in focus somewhat distracting.  Greens are a good shade on my monitor, by the way.</td>', 'Works well for the challenge, but I''d have preferred that one top leaf in focus - it''s prominence and position within the frame makes the fact it''s not in focus somewhat distracting.  Greens are a good shade on my monitor, by the way.', '2006-09-13 23:04:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2833381, 386851, 30982, '<td valign="top">Definitely met the challenge well.  I like the dark void that starts near the center at the top then runs down toward the right side.</td>', 'Definitely met the challenge well.  I like the dark void that starts near the center at the top then runs down toward the right side.', '2006-09-13 23:09:58.000000', NULL, 0),
