(2842512, 386661, 53147, '<td valign="top">Ok - Lets do some commenting. I gave this shot a 5. This was a tough challenge to vote in. While I think you dodged a main subject here teh pic left me with a feeling of "ok". Nice and clean but not a strong impact for me. But your 6+ score tells me you connected with others better than with me. Good focus and nice colors and nothing really to nit pick overall. Just no wow factor, which I guess is the dilemma since if you had an aspect that gave it wow then you may have had a subject. I dont know - just rambling now I guess.</td>', 'Ok - Lets do some commenting. I gave this shot a 5. This was a tough challenge to vote in. While I think you dodged a main subject here teh pic left me with a feeling of "ok". Nice and clean but not a strong impact for me. But your 6+ score tells me you connected with others better than with me. Good focus and nice colors and nothing really to nit pick overall. Just no wow factor, which I guess is the dilemma since if you had an aspect that gave it wow then you may have had a subject. I dont know - just rambling now I guess.', '2006-09-17 13:42:37.000000', NULL, 0),
