(2875603, 386723, 42495, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised this one scored so low; perhaps it was too abstract.  The thumbnail really grabs my attention and the color is great.  Constrast is very good.  Perhaps the watercolor filter didn''t appeal to some people, but for me it works well.  Perhaps zoomed out just a tad would leave more to look at.  Or maybe getting a bit more texture in upper right.  If I were voting, you''d get a 6 (maybe 7).</td>', 'I''m surprised this one scored so low; perhaps it was too abstract.  The thumbnail really grabs my attention and the color is great.  Constrast is very good.  Perhaps the watercolor filter didn''t appeal to some people, but for me it works well.  Perhaps zoomed out just a tad would leave more to look at.  Or maybe getting a bit more texture in upper right.  If I were voting, you''d get a 6 (maybe 7).', '2006-09-29 12:49:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2902714, 385678, 66353, '<td valign="top">I''m not a sucker for sunset pictures - actually I find most of them boring.<br/> <br/>Your shot here is one of the few exceptions to the rule. First of all because it''s a little different from most sunsets: There''s no horizon and theres no sky. The other great thing about it is the composition with the "golden triangle" in the corner - and the square format is just perfect for the picture.<br/> <br/>Excellent :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-06 10:38:02.</i></td>', 'I''m not a sucker for sunset pictures - actually I find most of them boring. Your shot here is one of the few exceptions to the rule. First of all because it''s a little different from most sunsets: There''s no horizon and theres no sky. The other great thing about it is the composition with the "golden triangle" in the corner - and the square format is just perfect for the picture. Excellent :)', '2006-10-06 11:37:41.000000', '2006-10-06 11:38:02.000000', 0),
(2908312, 385935, 55838, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot and a score north of 6 is always a great thing!  Nice composition (especially the foot steps) but overall it feels a wee bit too dark.  Possibly if you had the luxury of shooting during a different time of day it might have been brighter?  The border choice accents the darkness but on a more positive note, it makes it seem like I''m watching a beautiful movie that was filmed in the South Pacific.  Pretty sky &amp; water.</td>', 'Beautiful shot and a score north of 6 is always a great thing!  Nice composition (especially the foot steps) but overall it feels a wee bit too dark.  Possibly if you had the luxury of shooting during a different time of day it might have been brighter?  The border choice accents the darkness but on a more positive note, it makes it seem like I''m watching a beautiful movie that was filmed in the South Pacific.  Pretty sky & water.', '2006-10-08 15:00:14.000000', NULL, 0),
